DESCRIPTION:BEN WHITING | Hotel Brunswick | Thursday 17 September 6pm An al
 luring voice with rock beneath the surface Ben Whiting is a seasoned singe
 r-songwriter whose sound blends sun-soaked reggae grooves\, classic rock g
 rit and thoughtful folk songwriting. Raised on a steady diet of The Police
  and Bob Marley\, and shaped by years of jamming\, touring and festival st
 ages\, Whiting delivers music that feels both familiar and entirely his ow
 n. With a “virtually flawless” voice (Faster Louder) at the centre\, h
 is live shows move effortlessly between laid-back rhythms\, soaring melodi
 es and dynamic rock moments. Having previously played major festivals incl
 uding Splendour In The Grass and shared stages with artists like Katy Perr
 y\, Grinspoon and The Angels\, Whiting brings a confident\, polished perfo
 rmance that suits both relaxed afternoon sessions and attentive listeners 
 alike. Expect warm grooves\, rich vocals and songs that stay with you. Liv
 e at Hotel Brunswick 📅 Thursday 17 September 🕑 6:00pm | Free Gig
